                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tag": "a",
                    "attrs": {
                      "href": "/the-field/",
                      "class": "faith-secondary"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      "Explore a situation in The Field →"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "blockquote",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "What would this reading ask of the power I hold—and would I still call it loving if I were the person bearing its cost?"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
